HST Office: customizable quick access toolbar for Writer, Sheets, Slides and Draw.

1.0.2 ribbon (owner decision 14/11/2026, gap list G15): the notebookbar's shortcuts toolbox is the quick
access toolbar (sfx2/source/notebookbar/HstQuickAccess*).
- Defaults: Lưu, Hoàn tác, Làm lại. New, Open, Print, Print Preview, Send by Email (and Slideshow in Slides)
  wait, hidden, in the toolbar's list (each app's toolbar/notebookbarshortcuts.xml).
- Its ▾ menu (ToolBox menu: overflow » buttons first) has the common-command checklist, "Tùy chỉnh…" (the
  Customize dialog on this toolbar) and "Hiện bên dưới ribbon" / "Hiện bên trên ribbon".
- A right-click on any ribbon button (also in the compact ribbon's popup) offers "Thêm vào thanh truy cập
  nhanh"; on a quick access button "Xóa khỏi thanh truy cập nhanh".
- The commands are the app's notebookbarshortcuts UI configuration, saved in the user profile per app and
  independent of the placement (a later title-bar placement reads the same list); the placement is
  HSTRibbon/QatBelowApps.
- In the tab row the toolbar gets only the room the tabs and the search box's magnifier leave
  (NotebookbarTabControlBase::ImplPlaceTabs); the rest goes into its » menu, so the tabs, the ribbon and the
  banner never move. Below the ribbon it has its own row (HstSetShortcutsRow, ImplHstPageBottomReserve).
- KeyTips: Alt then 1–9 already reach the shortcuts toolbox's buttons (HstRibbonKeyTips).

